 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Present unreal conditional",
     "texto": [
      "It's used for something that isn't real now: **Wenn ich mehr Zeit hätte, würde ich Sport machen** (if I had more time, I would do sport). The «wenn» clause has the verb in the Konjunktiv II at the end; the main clause starts with **würde** + infinitive.",
      "With **sein**, **haben** and the modals you use the Konjunktiv II directly: **wäre** (would be), **hätte** (would have), **könnte** (could). These are the most common forms."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Forms of the Konjunktiv II",
     "texto": [
      "Some common forms are based on the Präteritum and may take an umlaut: **kommen → käme**, **gehen → ginge**, **wissen → wüsste**. Not all verbs change the vowel; with many, **würde + infinitive** is used. The Konjunktiv II expresses hypothesis or politeness, not \"when\"."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
